<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/claim/MIGDL-658-fix10> a migdl:TicketClaim ; migdl:claimsAbout <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/work/MIGDL-658> ; migdl:claimedBy <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/map/data-journey-v4> ; migdl:claimedStatus "Not Started" ; migdl:agreesWithJira true . <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/pipeline/A> a migdl:Pipeline ; skos:prefLabel "Pipeline A" ; dct:title "Bronze to Silver, with descriptors" ; migdl:runsInWindow "7 am to 7 pm" ; migdl:districtsPerRun "11 districts/day today" ; migdl:maxDataAgeDays 18 ; migdl:maxDataAgeDaysApp 11 ; dct:description "Not the binding step. Validation is a manual Athena count query, Bronze against Silver." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/bronze> ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/silver> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/pipeline/B> a migdl:Pipeline ; skos:prefLabel "Pipeline B" ; dct:title "Silver to Gold and Platinum" ; migdl:runsInWindow "7 pm to 5 am" ; migdl:districtsPerRun "7 districts/night today; ceiling 10 at one district per job" ; migdl:maxDataAgeDays 29 ; migdl:maxDataAgeDaysApp 17 ; dct:description "The binding constraint. 200 districts take 29 nights, 17 for the 122 on MiRead and MiEWIMS. Ten or twenty districts per job reaches 2 days or 1. More RPUs did not help." ; migdl:bindingConstraint true ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/gold> ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/platinum> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/pipeline/C> a migdl:Pipeline ; skos:prefLabel "Pipeline C" ; dct:title "Platinum to apps" ; migdl:runsInWindow "5:00 to 5:30 am" ; migdl:districtsPerRun "all districts; about 1 minute per district" ; migdl:maxDataAgeDays 1 ; migdl:maxDataAgeDaysApp 1 ; dct:description "What else runs here (cache warm-up, SPICE refresh, app-side pull) is not in Runbook v2.0." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/delivery> . <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/job/1> a migdl:EtlJob ; skos:prefLabel "Amorphic Ed-Fi connector" ; migdl:jobTech "AWS Lambda" ; skos:definition "Pulls by ChangeVersion plus the deletes list; marks the tracker RUNNING - BRONZE LOAD COMPLETED." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/bronze> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/job/2> a migdl:EtlJob ; skos:prefLabel "maisa_edfi_gold_descriptors_masterdata" ; migdl:jobTech "AWS Glue" ; skos:definition "317 descriptors straight from Bronze into gold.edfi_gold_alldescriptors_masterdata, skipping Silver. One native MERGE per district-year. Must finish before Silver and Gold." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/gold> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/job/3> a migdl:EtlJob ; skos:prefLabel "edfi_bronze_to_silver" ; migdl:jobTech "AWS Glue, Spark" ; skos:definition "Classifies IU / D / KeyChange, explodes child arrays (244 child and 28 grandchild tables), SCD2 merge into the district's Iceberg tables." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/silver> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/job/4> a migdl:EtlJob ; skos:prefLabel "edfi_silver_to_gold_and_platinum" ; migdl:jobTech "AWS Glue + Redshift SQL" ; skos:definition "Gold main (81 entities), then Gold derived, then the 24 Platinum statements. Rerun a phase alone with EXECUTE_MODE main, derived, only_platinum or all." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/gold> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/job/5> a migdl:EtlJob ; skos:prefLabel "maisa_silver_staging_etl_workflow" ; migdl:jobTech "orchestration" ; skos:definition "Chains the three steps; each waits for the one before, stops at first failure, emails on success and failure. Schedule: edfi_data_curation_schedule." . <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/callout/A> a migdl:Callout ; skos:prefLabel "Callout A" ; dct:title "The only door into the source" ; dct:description "Every byte MiGDL holds enters through this one Lambda. It runs under a 15-minute ceiling against rate limits nobody has documented, and it cannot tell which endpoints actually carry deltas. AWS can scale everything to the right of this arrow; this arrow sets the pace." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/midatahub> ; migdl:evidenceRef "Epic 4 (Ingestion at Scale). Tiger Team 1. Not yet in Jira." .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/callout/B> a migdl:Callout ; skos:prefLabel "Callout B" ; dct:title "Where deletes and ID changes get lost" ; dct:description "The job matches rows on lakeid, a hash rebuilt from the record's key columns. A delete arrives carrying only the Ed-Fi id and empty key columns, so the hash cannot be built and nothing matches. One cause, three symptoms: deletes no-op, key changes duplicate, key-changing corrections duplicate." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/silver> ; migdl:evidenceRef "G1, match on the Ed-Fi id too (MIGDL-118, 280). Building." .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/callout/C> a migdl:Callout ; skos:prefLabel "Callout C" ; dct:title "149 cabinets, one checkout line" ; dct:description "Left of this arrow every district has its own tables and runs in parallel. Right of it, all 149 write the same ~350 Redshift tables under table locks and one commit queue, 200 to 350 commits each. Redshift locks whole tables, every statement auto-commits into one serialized queue, and all 81 entities run whether or not anything changed — so the cost is per district and fixed, and does not shrink as nightly change volume shrinks." ; migdl:atStation <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/station/gold> ; migdl:evidenceRef "Epic 2 (district groups, split jobs); Epic 3 long term. Partly done." . <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/miewims> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiEWIMS" ; migdl:deliveredVia "API + QuickSight" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration true .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/miread> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiRead" ; migdl:deliveredVia "API" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration true .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/misafestudent> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiSAFEStudent" ; migdl:deliveredVia "API" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration true .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/community-schools-manager> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "Community Schools Manager" ; migdl:deliveredVia "API" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration false .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/mistrategybank> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiStrategyBank" ; migdl:deliveredVia "API" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration false .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/micoachcompass> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiCoachCompass" ; migdl:deliveredVia "manual entry" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration false . <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/decision/1> a migdl:Decision ; dct:title "How much history does the Gold layer keep?" ; dct:description "Today the lake treats 16 record types as “never changes” and 34 as “just overwrite.” A review of all 81 record types found that every one of them does change, and 74 of 81 could be needed for time travel. MAISA needs to confirm the assumption before the resolution proceeds." ; dct:creator "MAISA" .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/decision/2> a migdl:Decision ; dct:title "Do the app shelves need to answer “what did we know on a given date?”" ; dct:description "Nine app-facing tables were built to keep history but never close out old versions." ; dct:creator "MAISA" .
